          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/vz717bq6543#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Crop 1, lower panel upright; pencil, nothing else in the crop. Five figures, no separators: 1 9 8 1 4. The 8 has both bowls closed and crossing, so it is not the open-topped 6 that reading.md warns of; the 9 has a closed head and a descender; the two 1s share the same leading flag. Read as 19.8.14."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
